    <string name="looks_why_door">Why am I seeing a stock photo?</string>
    <string name="looks_explanation">One scenario didn\'t pass the quality gate after every attempt, so it shows the stock photo rather than a version of you that isn\'t right. It retries on its own when generation improves.</string>
    <string name="looks_empty_line">No looks yet — your first look is on its way.</string>
    <string name="permission_location_privacy">Your location fetches your weather and names your place. Your most recent location is saved on this phone so RunWear reopens where you left off. Weather lookups send your coordinates, rounded to a rough area, to Open-Meteo; place-name lookups send them to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim). Your location is never sold or used for advertising.</string>
